  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p>At 11,928 feet, <strong>Mount Nebo</strong> is a summit in Utah. It has roughly 5,433 feet of topographic prominence. The Mount Nebo Trail is a 9.2-mile hike with about 3,294 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include Middle Nebo Peak, South Nebo Peak and Mount Timpanogos. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
